			<item>
				<title>Tutorial setup_codingclub_session()</title>
				<link>/tutorials/r_setup_codingclub_session/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/tutorials/r_setup_codingclub_session/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Before each coding club you will usually have to download some datasets&#xA;and some scripts. This can be done manually from the corresponding&#xA;GitHub webpages but it is much easier to use the&#xA;&lt;code&gt;setup_codingclub_session()&lt;/code&gt; function of the &lt;code&gt;inborutils&lt;/code&gt; package.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To begin, make sure that you have the latest version of &lt;code&gt;inborutils&lt;/code&gt;&#xA;installed by running the following code:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-r&#34; data-lang=&#34;r&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#00a&#34;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (!&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a50&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;remotes&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; %in% &lt;span style=&#34;color:#0a0&#34;&gt;rownames&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0a0&#34;&gt;installed.packages&lt;/span&gt;())) {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#0a0&#34;&gt;install.packages&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a50&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;remotes&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;remotes::&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0a0&#34;&gt;install_github&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a50&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;inbo/inborutils&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Next load the package:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#fff;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-r&#34; data-lang=&#34;r&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0a0&#34;&gt;library&lt;/span&gt;(inborutils)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The function takes four arguments with the following default settings:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
